        "content": "<p>I mean, that would be <code>termElabAttribute</code> but what do you mean by \"hermetically sealed evalation outside of the lean runtime\"? The elaborators can refer to any Lean function or C function after all, so if you want to evaluate outside of <em>the</em> lean runtime, you essentially have to make your own lean runtime.</p>",
